   "body": "Fixed on a fork branch: `fix/3308-panel-subagent-effort` (head `2a75e5d3`, on upstream `6afbe3f3`) — the tray panel's subagent effort square is Default and won't open while Claude Code's subagents have no model.\n\n**Root cause.** `internal/gui/assets/app.js`'s `extraField` (`extra(f)` branch of the agent row, `SUB_EFFORT`) draws the panel's own square and never asks whether a subagent model is set: it shows Default (since `Get` now returns \"\" with no model), still opens the effort slider, and a level picked there is only stashed.\n\n**Change.** a `subEffortOff` helper decides the same thing the window's control does (no subagent model → off), the square is drawn disabled and unlit with the window's existing \"Set a subagent model first\" title (already in all five languages), and the off branch names it in `subEffortTitle`; a disabled style in app.css. No new i18n strings, what a picked level saves is unchanged.\n\n**Verified.** Red: `node --test internal/gui/tests/claude-subagent-effort-row.test.cjs on docker1 (playwright 1.62.1) against unmodified app.js` → `✖ chromium en: the panel's subagent effort square, disabled with none` at `claude-subagent-effort-row.test.cjs:177: AssertionError: false !== true` (`eff.isDisabled()`), the four no-model cases of 24\nGreen: `same command → `pass 24, fail 0` (chromium + webkit, en/zh); the with-model cases still open the slider and post `subagent_effort: high`` → `ℹ pass 24, fail 0`\n\n`TestCoreScriptBudget` passes (app.js 1,318,260 of 1,325,845 — no raise). No real tray-panel visual check beyond the two screenshots.\n\nFull `go test -tags nogui ./...` over round 26's branches: 70 packages ok, 5 red (edit `TestWriteAtomicReadOnlyHardLink`, gateway's five, plugin `TestPluginSOCKSProxy`, provider's synctest fatal in `TestUnreadLoginsWriteErrorsKeepCredentials`, testenv `TestProgram`) — every one of them reproduces identically at base `6afbe3f3` in this environment (umask 0027), so none is from this change.\n\nBranch: https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/3308-panel-subagent-effort — no PR opened, this repo takes no external PRs; say the word if you'd rather have the patch inline here.",
